<title>AUSTRIA: TABLE-Wolford full year net profit up.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Wolford full year net profit up.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Group results for the business year 1996/1997. (Figures in millions of schilling unless stated)</p>
<p>					     1996/97	1995/96</p>
<p> Sales				     1,652	  1,475</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit			    279.9	  241.7</p>
